{"5107070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dicey Darlings", "steam_appid": 5107070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5143680], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A board game roguelike featuring acrylic pieces and multi-sided dice!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the creative synergy of various items and their combinations—each class offers multiple roguelike builds to explore. Enjoy intense, satisfying gameplay where every trigger unleashes a cascade of physical dice rolls, or nail a series of consecutive successful checks at the last moment for an exhilarating burst of action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/25b0accb9a5de92b0700f6e20e3352d3.poster.avif?t=1788277213\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/25b0accb9a5de92b0700f6e20e3352d3.webm?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/25b0accb9a5de92b0700f6e20e3352d3.mp4?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are multiple ways to clear the stage.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you're unlucky and fail to form a powerful team? Use the weather, use the terrain, use the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/699a8db940c6361b5be5bdcc0f9b4a73.poster.avif?t=1788277213\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/699a8db940c6361b5be5bdcc0f9b4a73.webm?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/699a8db940c6361b5be5bdcc0f9b4a73.mp4?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooperate, compete, or betray? Each game offers a different storyline.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond combat, you can also choose items that enhance dialogue to take alternative paths—perhaps an unexpected storyline turns out to be the best one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/7dcf6d8475b700fd1921cd0074c4ed7b.poster.avif?t=1788277213\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/7dcf6d8475b700fd1921cd0074c4ed7b.webm?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/7dcf6d8475b700fd1921cd0074c4ed7b.mp4?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everyone has their own unique traits, and bosses are no exception.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather sufficient information—through dialogue or combat—about each boss's strengths and weaknesses, enter the Reflection Realm, and use your knowledge and strategy to challenge each floor's boss with maximum advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/148c31d7ca59c95cb76d162c51242bb5.poster.avif?t=1788277213\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/148c31d7ca59c95cb76d162c51242bb5.webm?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/148c31d7ca59c95cb76d162c51242bb5.mp4?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>    </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A board game roguelike featuring acrylic pieces and multi-sided dice!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the creative synergy of various items and their combinations—each class offers multiple roguelike builds to explore. Enjoy intense, satisfying gameplay where every trigger unleashes a cascade of physical dice rolls, or nail a series of consecutive successful checks at the last moment for an exhilarating burst of action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/25b0accb9a5de92b0700f6e20e3352d3.poster.avif?t=1788277213\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/25b0accb9a5de92b0700f6e20e3352d3.webm?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/25b0accb9a5de92b0700f6e20e3352d3.mp4?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are multiple ways to clear the stage.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you're unlucky and fail to form a powerful team? Use the weather, use the terrain, use the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/699a8db940c6361b5be5bdcc0f9b4a73.poster.avif?t=1788277213\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/699a8db940c6361b5be5bdcc0f9b4a73.webm?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/699a8db940c6361b5be5bdcc0f9b4a73.mp4?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooperate, compete, or betray? Each game offers a different storyline.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond combat, you can also choose items that enhance dialogue to take alternative paths—perhaps an unexpected storyline turns out to be the best one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/7dcf6d8475b700fd1921cd0074c4ed7b.poster.avif?t=1788277213\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/7dcf6d8475b700fd1921cd0074c4ed7b.webm?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/7dcf6d8475b700fd1921cd0074c4ed7b.mp4?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everyone has their own unique traits, and bosses are no exception.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather sufficient information—through dialogue or combat—about each boss's strengths and weaknesses, enter the Reflection Realm, and use your knowledge and strategy to challenge each floor's boss with maximum advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/148c31d7ca59c95cb76d162c51242bb5.poster.avif?t=1788277213\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/148c31d7ca59c95cb76d162c51242bb5.webm?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5107070/extras/148c31d7ca59c95cb76d162c51242bb5.mp4?t=1788277213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>